---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import headshot from "../assets/hasani-headshot.jpg";
---

<Base
  title="About Us | Hendrix Ventures Group"
  description="Hendrix Ventures Group LLC is an Atlanta real estate investment company owned and run by Hasani Hendrix, buying Georgia houses since 2020. When you call, you talk to the owner."
  path="/about"
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container-narrow about-grid">
      <Image
        src={headshot}
        alt="Hasani Hendrix, owner of Hendrix Ventures Group"
        width={320}
        densities={[1, 2]}
        class="about-photo"
      />
      <div>
        <h1>I'm Hasani. This is my company.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Hendrix Ventures Group is a small Atlanta real estate investment
          company — deliberately small. I've been buying Georgia houses since
          2020, and every documented purchase is on
          <a href="/houses-weve-bought">this site</a> with photos and dates.
          When you call, you talk to me.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-story">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2>How I work</h2>
      <p>
        Most people who call me aren't having their best month. An inherited
        house three states away, a rental that's become a burden, repairs
        that stopped being worth it, a timeline that won't wait for a
        traditional listing. My job is to give you one honest option: a real
        written offer, explained plainly, that closes when you need it to.
      </p>
      <p>
        Sometimes that offer is the right answer, and we close — a Georgia
        closing attorney supervises everything and your money never passes
        through my hands. Sometimes it isn't the right answer, and I'll tell
        you that too. Mike, one of the sellers on our
        <a href="/reviews">reviews page</a>, put it better than I could:
        "Everything that you said has been a hundred percent truthful. You
        tell me we're gonna close on this day — we're here that day."
      </p>

      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <ul class="dont-list" role="list">
        <li>We don't list houses — we're not agents and don't pretend to be.</li>
        <li>We never charge you anything. Not a fee, not a commission, ever.</li>
        <li>We don't renegotiate at the closing table.</li>
        <li>
          We don't pressure. The offer is free, in writing, and no is a
          complete answer.
        </li>
        <li>
          We don't claim to be a giant company. Small is why you get the
          owner on the phone.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>The company, on paper</h2>
      <ul class="facts-list" role="list">
        <li>
          <strong>Legal name:</strong> Hendrix Ventures Group LLC — Georgia
          control number 25188639. Don't take our word for it:
          <a
            href="https://ecorp.sos.ga.gov/BusinessSearch"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >look us up on the Georgia Secretary of State registry</a
          >.
        </li>
        <li><strong>What we are:</strong> a Georgia real estate investment company — a principal buyer, not a brokerage</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Address:</strong> 1700 Northside Dr NW, Suite A7 #813,
          Atlanta, GA 30318
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Phone:</strong>
          <a href="tel:+16787105786">(678) 710-5786</a> ·
          <strong>Email:</strong>
          <a href="mailto:hasani@hendrixventures.com"
            >hasani@hendrixventures.com</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Closings:</strong> conducted by independent Georgia closing
          attorneys, as Georgia law requires
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/get-offer" class="btn btn-primary">Get my cash offer</a>
        <a href="tel:+16787105786" class="btn btn-secondary"
          >Call or text (678) 710-5786</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding-block: var(--space-7) var(--space-5);
  }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .about-photo {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    height: auto;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  .about-story {
    padding-block: var(--space-5) var(--space-8);
  }
  .about-story h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }
  .dont-list,
  .facts-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
  .dont-list li {
    padding-left: var(--space-4);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent-warm);
  }
  .facts-list li {
    padding-left: var(--space-4);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-line);
  }
  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }
</style>
